ny big games with dozens  of complex moving parts your enjoyment  of planetside 2 on the PlayStation 4  rests on how forgiving you are of  technical pick ups that you would  properly expect to be vanquished it's  hard to miss those big problems but you  will temporarily forget about them when  battle is underway at these moments the  troubles fade away leaving only the  frights and delights of planetary war
 

